\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>lxrun default user and package update, lxss location, password reset, and C: mounts.<\/h2>\n\t<h2>lxrun<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>lxrun \/setdefaultuser &lt;user_name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>root<\/code> boots into that account directly.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>lxrun \/update<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUpdates package indexes.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Location<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%localAppData%\\lxss<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Reset password<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLog in as root:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>lxrun \/setdefaultuser root<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThen set the user password:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>passwd &lt;user&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Paths<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tC drive:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/mnt\/c<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUser files:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/mnt\/c\/Users\/&lt;user&gt;\/<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/bash\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/bash\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-fa